-- DECISIONS 79, batch 7 (integration owner's audit decisions, 2026-11-07) ·
-- Founder onboarding v10: the profile fields onboarding never asked.
--
-- New, required: F1.city and F1.founded_year (asked with the country) and
-- F1.one_line (after what the company does; Q drafts it for their yes).
-- They write the company's basics only: core.companies.headquarters_city,
-- founded_date (the year as its first day) and short_description, which
-- semantic matching reads. "I don't know" answers each and is recorded as
-- unknown. The legal name stays with verification, not onboarding.
--
-- v9 (and v1-v8) stay published and immutable: sessions pinned to them keep
-- running them. Every other step key, type, branch and write target is as
-- in v9. Additive only: no table, column, grant or policy changes, and
-- nothing is dropped.

